den 23&#x017F;ten April
1790.</hi></dateline>
<lb/>
<signed><hi rendition="#fr"><hi rendition="#c">Königl. Churfür&#x017F;tl. Amt.</hi></hi>
<lb/>
<hi rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Compe.<space dim="horizontal"/>
